 "strings": [
  "",
  "Of the Earth Federation Forces'",
  "land battles in the One Year War,",
  "Operation Odessa was the largest.",
  "Held to be the great turning point",
  "of the Federation-Zeon war,",
  "this battle was, in concrete terms,",
  "all but decided, it is said,",
  "the moment the Federation Forces",
  "had gathered most of the troops",
  "they could muster and were able",
  "to keep them amply supplied.",
  "The forces mobilized:",
  "8 for every 1 of Zeon's.",
  "Even if, thanks to mobile suits",
  "and other advantages, Zeon had",
  "three times the fighting strength,",
  "at 3 to 8 there would still be",
  "a gap of roughly threefold.",
  "By the age-old iron rule",
  "that defense counts threefold,",
  "this meant the defender's edge",
  "would not hold.",
  "That is, assuming Zeon went",
  "on the defensive,",
  "it would be an even fight,",
  "and in fact,",
  "that is how the battle played out.",
  "Like the awakening of spring,",
  "Federation forces sprang up",
  "everywhere at once, and Zeon",
  "gathered its forces and fell back.",
  "At this stage, Zeon's movements",
  "were perfectly organized.",
  "It was as deft as if",
  "prepared long in advance.",
  "The Federation, for its part,",
  "was only passably coordinated,",
  "but it had sheer numbers.",
  "In that sense, it deserves praise.",
  "For 3.4 million soldiers to drink",
  "one cup of coffee each takes",
  "an astronomical amount of supply.",
  "Merely to have",
  "managed this somehow",
  "deserves the highest praise.",
  "The Federation had preserved",
  "its ground forces everywhere.",
  "At times it even abandoned",
  "the citizens it should protect",
  "to keep its army intact,",
  "as the North American war showed.",
  "The Federation's ground forces,",
  "and General Revil who led them,",
  "thought that was as it should be.",
  "Amuro's Change",
  "On Revil",
  "A hero who did not look the part,",
  "Amuro, from around this time,",
  "was on the verge of great change.",
  "For better or worse,",
  "the Amuro known in later years",
  "began to take shape here.",
  "As Fraw Bow",
  "saw at a single glance,",
  "he was drawn to older women,",
  "and Matilda's death,",
  "for that very reason, left Amuro",
  "with a deep wound.",
  "He was the kind of person who,",
  "with \"protect\" as his watchword,",
  "could summon near-limitless power.",
  "That power, which blew away",
  "every assumption of the day,",
  "came less from an inborn gift",
  "than from his unmatched dread",
  "of \"failing to protect someone,\"",
  "one might say.",
  "Amuro, as a person,",
  "was not strong of heart.",
  "The truth was the opposite.",
  "And precisely because of that,",
  "he had to become",
  "the strongest of all.",
  "When defending themselves, people",
  "sometimes go far beyond the norm.",
  "For Amuro, the circle of what",
  "he counted as \"self\" was too wide.",
  "It went beyond mere compassion",
  "or kindness.",
  "\"Abnormal\" was",
  "the most fitting word for it.",
  "As though he were fighting",
  "to protect himself,",
  "at times, to protect others,",
  "he began to show limitless power.",
  "And then, Matilda died.",
  "It was from then on",
  "that Amuro stopped saying",
  "the things a child would say.",
  "For Amuro, whose sense of self",
  "stretched as wide as the cosmos,",
  "it must have been a wound",
  "beyond ordinary measure.",
  "Amuro,",
  "to protect himself,",
  "to escape any further sorrow,",
  "began to draw out still more power.",
  "There was a man, General Revil.",
  "A kindly old gentleman,",
  "he was the kind whose good nature",
  "had come to show in his face.",
  "Apart from a back held straight",
  "for his age, nothing about him",
  "looked like a soldier at all.",
  "Anyone who did not know",
  "would find it hard to imagine",
  "he was the working leader",
  "of the Earth Federation Forces.",
  "He too, like Amuro, was a man",
  "whose circle of self",
  "was far too wide.",
  "To put it unglamorously,",
  "he was a man of consideration,",
  "and it made him a great soldier.",
  "Not that he aimed for it.",
  "Like Amuro, quite unconsciously,",
  "he probably protected others",
  "as he would protect himself.",
  "Still, his circle of self",
  "was not as wide as Amuro's,",
  "and so he could save the army",
  "and leave the people to their fate.",
  "Perhaps he also reckoned",
  "that Zeon, with a public opinion",
  "of its own, could not easily",
  "make the people suffer.",
  "By odd chance, the battle",
  "was fought at the city of Odessa.",
  "Operation Odessa was, indeed,",
  "fought at Odessa.",
  "The Federation planned to encircle",
  "and crush Zeon in central Europe,",
  "but before it could,",
  "Zeon pulled back with fine timing,",
  "regrouped in an orderly withdrawal,",
  "and drew in its lines to hit back.",
  "Some found this excessive",
  "efficiency strange.",
  "Chief among them were those",
