  "Amuro was a battlefield warrior,",
  "but on very rare occasions",
  "he felled enemies off the field.",
  "This was one, and he would",
  "repay Matilda's death",
  "one debt at a time.",
  "That day, Amuro",
  "boarded the mobile headquarters.",
  "A hero, but a mere foot soldier.",
  "Even so, he got into headquarters.",
