  "something confidential.",
  "It was footage from a camera.",
  "Mobile Headquarters",
  "Amuro",
  "\"General Elran.\"",
  "\"This is what I mentioned, taken",
  " with an army camera that has",
  " official data built in.\"",
  "\"It should serve as evidence.\"",
  "Elran",
  "\"I see.\"",
  "\"So you mean to say",
