  "Federation Officer",
  "\"That's enough.",
  " Lower your gun, sir.\"",
  "\"Ugh, from behind...\"",
  "\"You don't seem used to",
  " firing a gun, sir.\"",
  "\"What will you do?",
  " I, on the other hand,",
  " am quite used to it.\"",
  "\"...Wait, don't shoot.",
  " I surrender.\"",
  "\"Very well.",
  " Good work, Amuro-kun.\"",
  "\"Everything you just said",
