  "\"Y-yes, sir.\"",
  "\"It seems White Base",
  " has gone into battle.",
  " Get back there at once.\"",
  "\"Good luck.\"",
  "M'Quve",
  "\"General Revil,",
  " commander of Operation Odessa,",
  " can you hear me?\"",
  "\"This is M'Quve.\"",
  "\"If you do not withdraw now,",
  " we are prepared to use",
  " a hydrogen bomb.\"",
  "\"This would, of course, violate",
  " the Antarctic Treaty, in which",
