  "\"We, too, would rather not lose.\"",
  "General Revil heard the message",
  "and said not a word.",
  "He merely waved his hand",
  "to signal the advance.",
  "Breaking the Antarctic Treaty",
  "would by itself turn the hearts",
  "of space's people from Zeon.",
  "Zeon was a Zabi dictatorship, but",
  "on paper it had a premier and diet.",
  "Such a thing could never be done,",
  "or so Revil thought.",
  "He had miscalculated.",
  "Hopeless as M'Quve was at war,",
  "he was blinder still to politics.",
  "\"What?",
  " Revil's army will not",
  " stop advancing?\"",
  "Uragan",
  "\"Yes, sir. They are breaking",
  " through our final defenses.\"",
  "\"...Curse them.\"",
  "\"So the Federation Forces",
  " have resorted to force.\"",
  "\"Then they shall have their wish.\"",
  "\"...But at this point?",
  " The outcome is already decided.\"",
  "\"This is a negotiation, you see.\"",
  "\"The Federation",
  " ignored our demands.\"",
  "\"And so they",
  " shall pay the price.\"",
  "\"Order the missile launched.\"",
  "Bright",
  "\"Amuro, can you hear me?",
  " The enemy is using an H-bomb.\"",
  "\"An H-bomb? But that's...\"",
  "\"That's right.",
  " The enemy is using a weapon",
