  "\"Who knows.\"",
  "\"It's public data from",
  " the Antarctic Treaty, at least.",
  " You can rely on it.\"",
  "\"Even the Gundam",
  " can't do",
  " just anything, you know!\"",
  "\"If the H-bomb is real,",
  " we'll be wiped out too.",
  " You have to do it, Amuro.\"",
  "\"If it's real?\"",
  "\"That's right.\"",
  "\"If it's real, huh...\"",
  "\"20 seconds left.",
  " And it's not about the Gundam.\"",
  "\"Amuro, I'm counting on you.\"",
  "\"That's a first.",
  " You saying something like that.\"",
  "\"...Here I go.",
  " Full power.\"",
  "\"C-can you do it?\"",
  "\"I have to!!\"",
  "\"Ohh!!\"",
  "Operation Odessa",
  "ended in a Federation victory.",
  "M'Quve",
  "had been quick to escape.",
  "\"The war does not end",
  " with this one battle.\"",
  "\"Consider the amount of ore",
  " we have already sent home.\"",
  "\"Zeon can fight ten more years.\"",
  "\"Ku ku ku ku... heh.\"",
  "The war",
  "was nearing a turning point.",
  "On the day M'Quve fled,",
  "the boys of White Base",
  "met General Revil",
